<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/brand/favicon-32x32.png?v=4"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/brand/favicon-16x16.png?v=4"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/brand/apple-touch-icon.png?v=4"><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=4"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="public-discovery about-page">
  <%- include('partials/public-header') %>
  <main class="about-shell">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>A clearer way to find what is happening on campus.</h1>
      <p>YCEP brings trusted YABATECH events into one calm, public space—so students can spend less time searching and more time showing up.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-principles" aria-labelledby="why-ycep">
      <div class="about-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Why it exists</span><h2 id="why-ycep">Built for a campus that moves fast.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-card-grid">
        <article class="about-card"><span class="about-card__number">01</span><h3>One place to look</h3><p>Approved events no longer have to disappear between flyers, group chats and word of mouth.</p></article>
        <article class="about-card"><span class="about-card__number">02</span><h3>Trust before reach</h3><p>Organizers are authorized and every event is reviewed by YABATECH Management before it becomes public.</p></article>
        <article class="about-card"><span class="about-card__number">03</span><h3>Open by default</h3><p>Anyone can discover published events. An account is only needed for trusted organizer workflows.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-flow" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <div class="about-flow__copy"><span class="eyebrow">The YCEP loop</span><h2 id="how-it-works">Simple on the surface.<br>Careful underneath.</h2><p>YCEP keeps publishing straightforward while preserving the checks that make campus information dependable.</p><a class="btn-primary" href="/">Discover events</a></div>
      <ol class="about-flow__steps">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>An organizer is approved</strong><p>A verified member receives organizer privileges from Management.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>An event is proposed</strong><p>The organizer prepares the details and submits the event for review.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>Management reviews it</strong><p>Only approved events become visible on the public campus calendar.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>4</span><div><strong>Everyone can discover it</strong><p>Students browse, search and filter without needing an account.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="about-closing">
      <span class="eyebrow">Made for YABATECH</span>
      <h2>Good events deserve to be found.</h2>
      <p>YCEP is a focused first version of a better campus information layer: useful, accountable and intentionally simple.</p>
    </section>
    <p class="about-credit">cc daveolana</p>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
